type: software
title: "inpage: a learning copilot that lives in the page"
abstract: "A Chrome and Edge extension for learning from what you read: ask about any selection, page, video moment or set of tabs with answers that quote and verify the page, rewrite passages in place with real maths, and fact-check claims, using the reader's own OpenRouter key."
